{{also|trouble maker}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From [[trouble]] + [[make]] + [[-er]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-troublemaker.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|trouble-maker}}
* {{l|en|trouble maker}} {{qualifier|proscribed}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who [[cause]]s [[trouble]], especially one who does so [[deliberately]].
# A [[complainer]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|hooligan}}
* {{l|en|stirrer}}
* See also [[Wikisaurus:troublemaker]]
* See also [[Wikisaurus:complainer]]

